      <section class="space-y-8">
        <h1 class="section-title">OSRS DMM Tracker Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary">Last updated: February 9, 2026. This policy explains what data may be collected when you use OSRS DMM Tracker (osrsdmmge.online) and what choices you have.</p>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">1. What We Collect</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary">OSRS DMM Tracker does not require an account and we do not ask you for personal information such as your name, address, or payment details.</p>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-secondary">
            <li>• <strong>Usage analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics to understand which pages and features are used.</li>
            <li>• <strong>Session insights:</strong> We use Microsoft Clarity to improve usability and fix UI issues.</li>
            <li>• <strong>Advertising:</strong> We use Google AdSense to display ads. Ad providers may use cookies or similar technologies.</li>
          </ul>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">2. Cookies & Similar Technologies</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary">Third-party services (Google Analytics, Google AdSense, Microsoft Clarity) may set cookies or collect device/browser information to provide analytics and ads. You can block cookies in your browser settings, but some features or ad experiences may be affected.</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">3. How Data Is Used</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary">We use aggregated analytics to improve content, performance, and user experience. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">4. Your Choices</h2>
          <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-secondary">
            <li>• <strong>Cookie controls:</strong> You can block or delete cookies in your browser.</li>
            <li>• <strong>Ad settings:</strong> You can manage ad personalization via Google Ad Settings.</li>
            <li>• <strong>Ad blockers:</strong> You may choose to use an ad blocker.</li>
          </ul>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">5. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary">We may update this policy from time to time. Continued use of the site after updates constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">6. Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-secondary">Questions about privacy? Email <a class="text-accent" href="mailto:tangjei414@gmail.com">tangjei414@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-center text-sm text-secondary">OSRS DMM Tracker is an independent fan project and is not affiliated with Jagex.</p>
